# Reverse proxy + automatic TLS for prime.service (127.0.0.1:3000).
#
# A plain reverse_proxy with no path matchers forwards every request
# unrewritten — including /.well-known/workflow/, which must reach eve
# byte-for-byte or Workflow callbacks stall forever (see the "traps" section
# of docs/ARCHITECTURE.md). Do not add path stripping or rewrites here.
#
# Replace the placeholder with the real hostname (an A record must already
# point it at this VM's public IP — Caddy's ACME challenge fails otherwise)
# before installing this file.
vm.gameseller.digital {
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:3000
}
